  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Liq 402.03 Licensee Entertainment. Retail licensee entertainment by alcohol industry members shall not be considered a violation of RSA 179:11, provided such entertainment is deductible as a business entertainment expense under the Internal Revenue Code.\n\nSource. #7779, eff 10-18-02; ss by #8243, eff 12-31-04, EXPIRED: 12-31-12\n\nNew. #10322, INTERIM, eff 4-25-13, EXPIRES: 10-22-13; ss by #10643, eff 7-18-14\n\nNew. #10322, INTERIM, eff 4-25-13, EXPIRED: 10-22-13\n\nNew. #10643, eff 7-18-14; ss by #14335, eff 8-2-25, EXPIRES: 8-2-35",
